WEBVTT

00:17:59.657 --> 00:18:02.754
and I found meaning in that surprise.

00:18:03.772 --> 00:18:07.262
In October, it was my 50th birthday,

00:18:07.286 --> 00:18:09.828
and my family organized a party for me.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.205
And in the middle of it,
my son said to my husband

00:18:13.229 --> 00:18:14.976
that he wanted to make a speech.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.158
And John said,

00:18:16.182 --> 00:18:20.241
"George, you can't make
a speech. You're four."

00:18:20.265 --> 00:18:21.946
(Laughter)

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:26.491
"Only Grandpa and Uncle David and I
are going to make speeches tonight."

00:18:26.515 --> 00:18:29.110
But George insisted and insisted,

00:18:29.134 --> 00:18:32.582
and finally, John took him
up to the microphone,